{{ instagramBand({ id: "instagram", posts: instagram.posts, photos: shop.photos.studio }) }}{% endraw %}{% endset %}
  {{ usage(code) }}
  <p><strong>Used on:</strong> Home, About (without photos)</p>
  <p>Posts come from <code>scripts/instagram.js</code>: fetched with the Instagram API at build time, then downloaded and resized onto this site. That means no embed, third-party script or tracking. Each post is a link named by its caption (“Instagram post (1 November 2026): …”). Without <code>INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>, the studio photos below stand in as one decorative link to the profile.</p>
</section>

